<p>Before he went to get the bus, I got down on a knee.</p>
<p>“What’s the most important thing?” I asked him.</p>
<p>“ROI,” he said.</p>
<p>“And what do we strive to do every day?” I asked him.</p>
<p>“Move the needle,” he said.</p>
<p>“And do we raise our hand before we ask a question?” I asked him.</p>
